<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">Solomon La</book>
  <para style="h">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="toc1">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="toc2">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="mt">Solomon La</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Late Solomon la ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mi tawpna kam in hing tawpleh izaw! aziehpen na itna lah uoin sangin ahum zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na sathau gimnamtui kinu ziehin, na min khu sathau buhkhieh bang mai ahi a, tuaziehin nungah siengthouten ahing ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hingpui in, nanua hing zui va ung; leengpa’n a pindan sungah ahing puilutta hi, Nangma ah kipahin ka nuom ding ua, na itna khu uoin sangin ka thei ngitnget zaw ding uh a, dihtah in ahing it ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw nou Jerusalem tanute aw, Ka mel avom vangin, Kedar puon innte bang leh Solomon puonjahte bangin ka kilawm veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka melvom zieh leh nisa’n ahing kah ziehin hing en en sih un. Ka nu tapate ka tungah alungthah ua, amaun kei grep huonte veng in ahing koi ua, hinanleh keima grep huon ka veng tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw nang ka ngainou, hing hil vawi in, na belamhonte heisunga na vah ahiei? bangzieh a kei na lawm na guolte belamhonte lah a, maikhu lienu bang ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lienu zatam lai a sahmel etlawm pen aw; na theisih leh belamhonte sulnua zui inlen, belam chingte puonbuh gei ah na kelnoute chingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngainou aw, ken nangpen Pharaoh sakolleng kaite lah a, sakol la khat toh kahing tekah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na biengte gel na kizepna in aetlawmsah a, na ngawng toh sana khi awte akilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kouten nanga dingin dangka gui a kizem, sana khi ka hing bawlpieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengpa dawkan a ann ne a atou laiin, ka spikenat sathau namtui in agimnamtui, akikhawkhesah va hiau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa khu kei a ding in mirrah gimnamtui thawl zan tungtawn a ka nawite gel kikaal a lum bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ngainou khu kei a dingin, En-gedi grep huona heisapahlun bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />En vawi, ka ngainou aw, na sahmel etlawm hi, En vawi, na kilawm seng seng a, na mitte gel zong khuvanu mit abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Envawi, ka ngai tangpa, sahmel etlawm na hi a, duongkuoi etlawm na hi; i laikhun tung zong tulsingna bangin eng ding deng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I innkamte sidar sing ngen ahi a, Tualeh innkute zong taa sing ngentang ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei Sharon rose pahlun ka hia, phaijang lili pahlun ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Linglah lili pah bangin lienu zatam lai ah, ka ngai lienu sawlbang a hei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gammang tulsing lah a epul singkung bangin, ka ngai tangpa zong, taang zatam lai ah sawlbang ahei a, alim nuoi ah nunnuom tutvum khawl in, aga ka tepleh ningzu humnou abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman guolvahna ann kuong luina inn ah ahing zawpi a, tualeh apuonlap khu ka tungah anbang itna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grepga gawte in hing kaihing unlen, epul theiga in hing suhal un, lawmngai khamkha ka veita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Akhut veilam ka lutang nuoi ah akoi a, aziet lam khut in ahing kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem tanute aw, sasan leh gam sazuhpite siel in ka hing ngen ahi; ki it kingaina pen, alungkim masangsie’n tohthou sih unlen, phawng zong phawng sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngaitangpa tongdam ka za hi, En in ahing pei hi, muol dung tawn in ahing kidieng suh a, muolte ahing kantan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa khu sazuhtal leh sakhital dawnglai bang ahi a, En vawi, ka baang pang uah adinga, kotta hawmte ah ahing en a, ka baanghawmte uah ahing kaihit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa’n ka kungah, “Ka ngainou melhoi hing thou inlen, hing zui maive, chi’n ang houpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen en in phalbi abeita a, Guo atheuta a khuo aphata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leitungah papete ahing kilangta a, la sah hun ahing tungta hi, Tualeh igamah huivanu tong awi kizata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theipi kungin aga hingte asuongta a, grep pahlun in agimnamtui langsahta hi; Thou in duongsuo kilawm ka ngainou hing zuiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kawlhawm suongpi kaal a kibu ka khuvanou aw, munsang kawlhawm a kibu ka khuvanou aw, na mel hing musah inlen, na aw nem hing zasah in, na tongdam anem a, na sakmel etlawm seng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koute dingin grep gui susie si-alnoute hing mat pieh un, aziehpen ka grepguite asusie ua grepga hoitah agasah sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ngaitangpa keia ahia, kei zong ama a ka hi. Ama’n lili pahte lah ah belam aching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni ahing nema, ni himte akiheimang masangsie’n; kiheiven ka ngainou, Bether muolte tunga sazuhtal leh, sakhitalnou dawnglai akihei bangin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zankhang kimchieng laikhun tungah, lunga ka it sabang vai veng, nanleh sahmel mu zou lang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuin ka thou dinga, vangkholai teng sabang ka vai dinga, khopi kot zing teng leh, mun chin teng ah ka vah kawi dinga, ka ngai tangpa ka sui dinga,” ka sui ngitnget a, ka muzou tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khopi sung venga vah kawi miten, Kei ahing mu ua, Ken amau kungah “Ka ngai tangpa na mukha uoi?” Ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauh ka hen bepin, ka ngai tangpa ka muta a, ka nu innsungah ka puilut a, keima hing na pai kanu pindan sunga, ka puilut masangsie’n, ka tudetta a, apei ding ka phal nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem tanute aw, itna alungkim masangsie’n, phongsih unlen, khanglousah sih un, chi’n gamlah sazuhtal leh, sakhital noute siel in ka hing ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamdai a kipat a meikhu kitung banga, hing peidoh khu koi ahiei? Murra leh begaw akizut a, summetbawl mite gimnamtui vui a, kizut khu koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />En vawi, alupna khu Solomon lupna ahi, mihangsan sawmguhin akimkot ah a imkhum ua, Israel mihangsante’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A bawn un namsau atawi chiet ua, galdou siem ngen ahi uh, zanlai chienga zauna zieh in apheizum uah namsau akuo chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leengpa Solomon in Lebanon singin, sakolleng touna khat ama a dingin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akhuomte dangka sia in abawl a, a tunna sana, atouna puonsan dup in atuom a, asunglam Jerusalem tanuten, anbang itna toh apha suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw nou Zion tanute pawtdoh unlen, azi ding moulop ni leh alungtang kipah ni in; Atunnu’n akhusah leengpa Solomon leenglukhu hing en un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En vawi, ngainou na kilawm hi, En vawi, na kilawm seng seng hi. Na maikhuna sungah na mitte khuvanu mit abanga, na sam zong Gilead muol a hing, kumsuh kelhonte abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na hate lah belamhon mul kimetsa, kisilsieng sitset bangin avaam hi, Keelpi zousie’n akop kopin nou anei ua, alah uah achiing khat beeh a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na nephute sawn au san abanga, na kamsung zong a etlawm mama hi. Na maikhuna diel lie ah na biengte, kawlbuthei kiphalhah abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngawng lah galhangte namtem leh lum leh, phaw kikhaina David innsang bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nawite gel lah lili pah lah a aphit a, pieng sazuhtalnou gamta bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni ahing nem a, nihimte akikhin mang masangsie’n mirrah taang leh, begaw muol kava pha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na melhoi seng taluo hi ka ngai lienu, na kungtungah nuolna ding a um vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngai lienu Lebanon akipat in hing pei in, Lebanon apat in peikhawm vai, Amana muolvum leh Senir leh Hermon muolvum akipat, tualeh humpibahnei kuote apat leh, kamkei muolte akipat in en suh vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang kalaizom ka ngai lienu, ka lungsim na zougawpta hi. Na mit langkhat a nang mitsih atnain, ka lungsim na lamangta a, Na suong manpha khigui khat in zong, ka lunglai akuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anbang na itna kilawm hina va-ia e, ka laizom leh ka ngai lienu, Anbang na itna ningzu sangin, humzaw na duong gimsi, gimnamtui dangteng sangin namtui zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ngai lienu na nephute khuoiphanga khuoizu bangin atakhie a, na lei nuoi ah khuoizu leh nawitui a um a, na puonsil gimnamte lebanon gimsi a nam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka laizom ka ngai lienu aw, huon ki imbang na hi a, tuinah kihu, tuikul ki sing bang na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na singkungte lah kawlbuthei huon a, ga kilawm tahtah adim, heisapah leh spikenat gimnamtui bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Spikenard leh saffron, kawltu gimnamtui leh singthal, begaw, murrah leh aloe gimnamtui theitawp singkung zousie toh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huonte a tuinahnei, tuihing tuikhuh leh, Lebanon apata lui luongte abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw mallam huikhi khanglou in, Aw hing peiin sim huikhi, ka huonsungah hing lang inlen, gimnamtuite azamdoh theina dingin, Kangainou ka huonsungah hing lut henlen, theiga tui pente hing ne hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka laizom ka ngai lienu, aw, ka huonsungah ka hing peita hi, Ka murrah leh gimnamtuite ka lakhawm a, khuoizuphang leh khuoizu ka neta hi; Ka uoin zong ka nawitui toh akidawnta hi; Aw ka lawm leh guolte ne unlen dawn un, nou aki it akingaite aw nieng leh, tai tah in ne unlen dawn un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Laikhun tung maimit ka sin hangin, sinlailungin maimit singlou, “Ngai vawi, ka ngai tangpa’n kot ahing kiu a, ka ngai tangpa tongdam nem in, kot hing hon ven, ka tuoi, ka ngai lienu ka vakhunou, ka deiteng kimna nu aw, Aziehpen ka lutang daitui in anom siengta, ka sam zousie daitui in apah siengta,” ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka puonsilte ka sut zouta a, ka bangchi sil kia ding a diei? Ka kengte ka silzouta a, bangchin ka niehsah thei kia diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa’n akhut kothawm ah ahing gol lut a, tuabep in ka lungsim a tunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa kot hon dingin ka thoudoh a, ka khutte murrah in ka zut a, ka khutmete murrah tui gimnamtui ka nu a, kot kilna tungte ah zong ka nu suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa kot kava honta a, hinanleh ka ngai tangpa ana nua pei kiata a, ana peitumta hi. Aman thu agen laiin ka lungsim in ama lam ka zuon a, Ama ka sui a, hinanleh ka muzou sih, ama ka han a, ahing dawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khopi venga vahkawi kawiten ahing mu ua, ahing vuo ua, ahing liemsahta uhi kulbang vengten, ka maikhuna puon kei apat in alamangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem tanute aw, ka hing ngen vanguo hi, ka ngai tangpa na mu khah u’leh, ama vangngai khamkha veilawta ka hi, chi’n na hil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lienu zatam lai a etlawm tungtuong pen aw, na ngaitangpa tangdang sanga atungtuonna bang ahiei? Na ngainou, midangte ngainou sanga, a etlawmna bang atuom ei? Bang dinga koute tambang lawma nei nget ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa angou a asan hiu hiau hi, tul sawm lai a etlawm tungtuong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Alutang zong sana sieng set bang ahi a, asamte akil hoi mama va-ah bangin a vom dingdeng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amitte gel lui tuite gei a vahui mit, nawitui a kisilsieng kituohtah a kiphut bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abiengte gel pen pape gimnamtui pouna huonsung a, gimnamtui zam sah bang ahi a, anephu zong lili pallun murrah tui takhie bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A khutte lah beril suongmantam a, kizem sana chieng bang ahi a, atahsa zong saiha kisui zol, saphire suongmantam a kiluonkhum bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Akengte gel zong sana sieng set, khuom tunna tunga kitung suong ngou khuomte bang ahi a, amel etlawm dan lah sidar sing sangte a kizem, Lebanon muol bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kam ahum penpen a, Ahi, amapa apumpi’n adeihuoi ahi; Aw Jerusalem tanute, Ama ahi anbang ka it tangpa, ama ahi kalawmpa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lienu zatam lai a, sahmel hoipen nu aw, na ngai tangpa heikuom sawlbang ahei a hiei? Hing hil vawi in, sangbang ka hing vaipi theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa ahuonsung gimnamtuite, pouna huon sungah ava haw hi; ahuonsunga belamte ching ding leh, lili pahte lakhawm dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei ka ngai tangpa a ka hi a, ka ngai tangpa zong kei a ahi; ama’n lili pah lah ah abelamte aching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw anbang ka it lienu, Tirzah bangin na melhoi a, Jerusalem bangin na dei huoi hi, puonlap tawi galkap hon bangin na giin huoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mitte gel kei apat in heimangin, aziehpen ahing et chieng un, ahing zou seng ua ka duong anem hi; na samte zong Gilead muol dunga, kelhon kizawtsuh abang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hate lah belamhon kisil zoupan abanga, abawn un ta a nei kop chiet ua, alah uah achiing khat zong a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mai khuna lie ah na biengnou, kawlbuthei kiphalhah ausan hiu hiau abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lengnu sawm guh a um a, amei sawm giet a um a, tualeh ngahnu siengthou sim senglou a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lungdeinou, ka huivanu, hoibukimnu atunnu von lienu neisun, tunnu von lungdeinou hibou, vontawi lie dangtengin, lie nunnuom chi tuomse uh; Lengnute leh meinuten zong, ka ngai lienu aphat chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Zing taikhovah banga et lawmnu khu koi ahiei? Hapi banga etlawmnu, ni banga tangphanu leh, galzawna diellap tawi a kizawt galkap hon banga zau huoinu khu koi ahiei?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Phaijanga theigate en dingin be lei huon ah ka peisuh a, grep guite adawn suongta uoi en dingin, kawlbutheite apahta uoi en dingin ka kuonsuhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka khophawh masang lai nangawn in, ka lunggulna in ka miliente sakolleng bangin, ahing bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hing kile kia in, hing kile kia in, Aw nang Shulam nu Kouten ka hing et theina ding un. Lamgui ni a kichiengte kikaal a, lam banga bang dinga, Shulam nungah a et et ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na kedap toh na kengte kilawm hina e, Aw leengtapate tanu, na malpitegel suongmantam kheng siemte, khut suoh bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na laikuoh khu ningzu kihal tasamlou a umna, nou bem bang ahi a, na kawng zong mangbu vum akimvel a, lili pape pou bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na nawite gel zong sazuhnou piengkop bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngawng zong saiha akibawl innsang bang ahi a, na mitte gel khu Bath-Rabbim kotpi gei a, Heshbon tuikhuhte bang ahi ua, na nahkuo lah Damaska lam nga a, Lebanon muol a innsang kilam bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lutang zong Karmel muol bang kumpinu lukhu ahi. Na sam kaisuhte zong puonsandup kikhai abang ahi; tua na sam bawhte ah leengpa sal a mat in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngai lienu aw, kilawm sengin, lungkim huoina va-ia chie; Na itna in hing kipah sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na duong kilawm tum sing bang ahi a, na nawite gel zong grepga bawh bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tum singah ka kaltou dinga, aba hiengte ka tudet ding ka chi a; tuin na nawite gel grepga bawhpha bang henlen, na nah hute apple gimsi nam hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh na kam tunglam ningzu humpen abang hi. Tua ningzu humnou ka ngai tangpa kamsungah, dam di diei in luongsuh henlen; imute muh leh kam ah luong suh hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa a ka hi a, alaikuoi leh lunggul kei ka hi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa hing pei vawi, gamlah ah va vah vaiin, khota ah gieh den mai vai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zingmawng matah in ithou dinga grep huon ah ihaw ding a, grep guite ameng doh taimah, tualeh kawlbutheite amumdoh taimah, va enta vai; tua mun ah anbang kang itna ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zawldei ai agimnam alaangsah a, ikotpi phung ah zong, theiga tuituoh chi tuom tuom alui atha, nanga dinga ka kholkhawm a um hi, Aw ka ngai tangpa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Nangpen ka nu nawitui tep a, ka sanggampa hing hita mai lachin maw! Pulam a ka hing mu chiengin ka hing tawp dinga, Ahi, koiman ahing simmaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hing zawpi dinga, ka nu innsungah ka hing lutpi dinga, ka nu’n ang hilna bangin, ka kawlbuthei tui akipat ningzu hum leh, gimnamtui kihal ka hing dawnsah nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aban veilam ka tangkhapa, aban zietlam in ahing kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hing ngen vanguo hi; Aw Jerusalem tanute anbang itna, alungkim masangsie’n phawng sih unlen, khanglou sah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamdai akipat a, angai tangpa tunga kingam a hing pei koi ahiei mah? Apple sing nuoi ah ka hing phawnga, tuanah na nu’n nangma ahing hingdoha, tua mun ah nang hing pai, na nuin nang ang neikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ban a chiemtena na nam bangin, na lungtang ah kei chiemtena nam in, aziehpen itna zong shina bangin ahat hi, thangsietna zong hankhuh bangin agilou hi; tuatah kammei kuongte, meikuong nasatah a kileh bangmai ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui tampi in abuohmit theilou, tui sanglet ten zong atawmang thei lou anbang itna; mi khat in anbang itna sesum, lamtam in lei sawm nanleh leizou lou dinga, bangman kingai piehlou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kouten sanggam numei neu nalai khat ka nei uhi, nawi anei nai sih a, mite’n amanu ahing dawp ni chiengin, ka sanggamnu dingin bang ka bawlta ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amanu kulbang hitaleh, atungah dangka sia in innsang ka lam ding ua, tualeh amanu kotkha hitaleh, sidar peh in ka imkhum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kulbaang ka hi a, ka nawite zong innsang bang ahi uhi. Tuachi’n kei zong, ama mitmu ah lungmuonna mu mi khat ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon in Baal-Hamon ah grep huon khat anei a, huon hou a kilawte khut ah akemsah a, akemte zousie’n agate man ding, dangka tul khat chiet ahing tawi ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka grep huon pen kei a mawng ahi a, Nang, Aw Solomon, dangka tul khat na kitan dinga, a kem miten dangka zani a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huonsunga teng noute aw, ka lawm guolten na aw gin angaikhie ua, kei zong hing zasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa hing kinaw in, muoldawn tumtai pouna muol dungah sazuh tal leh, sakhitalnou bangin hing kidieng suh in.
  </para>
</usx>
